# Generated artefacts.
#
# The trained forecaster and the scoreboard are committed anyway (git add -f):
# the API reports `degraded` without models/forecaster.pkl, so a fresh clone
# could not be run without a 3-minute training step first. 3.4 MB is worth
# not asking a reviewer to build the model before seeing the console.
#
# The PPE vision weights under models/vision/ stay out: they are optional
# (SENTINEL_VISION is off by default, nothing on the safety path imports them)
# and they are derived from SH17, whose licence does not permit
# redistribution through this repo.
models/
reports/
data/regulations_local/

# Downloaded datasets (SH17 sample imagery etc.) — fetched, not authored.
# Licences differ per dataset; do not redistribute through this repo.
data/external/
# YOLO weights, downloaded on first use
*.pt

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Env
.env
.env.local

# Playwright browser cache
.cache/

# Local onboarding guide (docs/) — kept out of version control on purpose.
# Delete this line if you want to share it with a teammate through git.
docs/
